{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0ac75b5f807396f0","name":"Imperial Gunner","source":{"id":"source:reference-0ac75b5f807396f0","title":"Imperial Gunner","revision":21623,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:09:47Z","sha256":"8389552710ebd90dc8bbf7519fedd22fc6160e0b572eb28fa58b572251de8a22","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21623","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Imperial%20Gunner&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0ac75b5f807396f0","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Star Wars Miniatures Previews"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Star_Wars_Miniatures_Previews"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Fel Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Fel_Empire","referenceId":"reference:45bef1c82bffe9c1"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Death Star's personnel included thousands of Imperial Gunners to operate its turbolasers, tractor beams, and the massive, world-shattering superlaser itself. These Imperial Gunners were similar to those found on any Imperial Capital Ship, but they included many who were more experienced than the norm. Imperial Gunners wore a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blast Helmet and Vest"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blast_Helmet_and_Vest","referenceId":"reference:2b2d97a2d11da0c9"}," equipped with a high-quality head-up display that assisted them in targeting. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["To aid in repelling any hostiles that might penetrate a weapon emplacement, they often carried high-powered close range ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blast Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blast_Cannons"}," that sprayed multiple blaster shots at a target. In the close quarters of a turbolaser bunker or turret, these \"Blaster Shotguns\" were more deadly with a single trigger pull than almost any other handheld infantry weapon. In addition, most Imperial Gunners carried ",{"tag":"a","children":["Explosive Charges"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Explosive_Charges"}," so that they could act as impromptu combat engineers. The charges also allowed the Imperial Gunners to destroy any turbolaser enhancements that were in danger of being overrun by hostile troops. \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Imperial Gunner Statistics (CL 2)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +5; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low-Light_Vision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +9\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 14 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 12), ",{"tag":"